{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">愛知名古屋亞運，何詩蓓領港隊奪女子4x100米自由泳接力銀牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.SWIM-0600.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026SgwVBkqIv91789947967.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.SWIM-0600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港隊以總成績第四晉級決賽。馬紫玲完成第一棒後排第四，接棒的何詩蓓協助港隊衝上第二，之後的李芯瑤及簡棹桐都守著優勢，最終以3分35秒59，破香港紀錄時間奪銀，是游泳港隊今屆首面獎牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.SWIM-0600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ELB2NfAdXm1789947981.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.SWIM-0600_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家隊就破亞運紀錄奪金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:20.540250+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}